WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Thermostat
What it does: Regulates flow towards the radiator circuit according to coolant temperature.

2
00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Thermostat
How it works: As it warms, the thermal element moves the valve.

3
00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Thermostat
How it moves: The valve moves slowly as the capsule warms; it does not follow crankshaft revolutions.
